#: app/templates/about.html:6
msgid ""
"The Graduation Project Archival System (GPAS) is a web-based digital "
"repository developed for the Arab Open University — Kuwait Branch. It "
"centralises the storage, discovery, and dissemination of graduation "
"projects produced by the Faculty of Computer Studies."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/about.html:8
msgid "Goals"
msgstr "الأهداف"

#: app/templates/about.html:10
msgid "Preserve student work that would otherwise be lost."
msgstr "الحفاظ على أعمال الطلاب التي قد تُفقد لولا ذلك."

#: app/templates/about.html:11
msgid "Help current students learn from past projects."
msgstr "مساعدة الطلاب الحاليين على التعلم من مشاريع سابقة."

#: app/templates/about.html:12
msgid "Support faculty in advising and ensuring originality."
msgstr "دعم أعضاء هيئة التدريس في الإشراف والتحقق من الأصالة."

#: app/templates/about.html:13
msgid "Provide administrators with reporting and oversight."
