#: app/templates/about.html:15
msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "إمكانية الوصول"

#: app/templates/about.html:16
msgid ""
"The system is designed to conform to WCAG 2.1 Level AA, with full "
"keyboard navigation, descriptive alt text, sufficient colour contrast, "
"and bilingual English/Arabic support including right-to-left layouts."
