#: app/templates/privacy.html:5
msgid ""
"GPAS stores only the personal data needed to operate the repository: your"
" name, university email, role, language preference, and a record of the "
"projects you upload, view, or download."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:6
msgid ""
"Passwords are never stored in plain text — they are hashed using the "
"bcrypt algorithm. All session activity is restricted to the GPAS "
"application and is automatically expired after 30 minutes of inactivity."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:7
msgid ""
"Access logs are retained for usage statistics and security auditing. They"
" contain a timestamp, IP address, browser identifier, the project "
"accessed, and your account ID where applicable."
msgstr ""

#: app/templates/privacy.html:8
